# Licence

This skill's own files are unlicensed — yours to use as you see fit.

`icons/` is not. It vendors theSVG brand marks and Phosphor UI glyphs,
redistributed unmodified under the MIT licence, which requires the notice to
travel with the files. Keep this file with the folder if you redistribute it.

`skills/asd-ste100/` is also not ours. It is a byte-for-byte copy of
danyuchn/asd-ste100-skill (MIT, Copyright 2026 Dustin Yuchen Teng), kept
unmodified so it stays updatable. Its own licence travels with it at
`skills/asd-ste100/LICENSE`, and it is excluded from this skill's own docs checks
because its prose is not ours to edit.
